cific validation; do not infer generic planning or successor-feature guarantees.","severity":"low","source_receipt_id":"expert-RVM-001-pilot-v4-p0000-base-forward-577e37afed31","source_role":"expert"},{"category":"metadata_revision_not_new_data","evidence":"Semantic task, rendered input, gold, difficulty and split are byte-equivalent under typed canonical comparison to the prior batch. This correction contributes zero new source families relative to that batch.","fix":"Supersede the prior source-family version and avoid counting both as independent training data.","severity":"low","source_role":"independent_adjudicator"},{"category":"bounded_repeated_mechanism_scope","evidence":"Fresh metadata restores factual competency descriptions; fixed move rules, goal/rank objective and recurring error patterns remain. Development is exposed; no efficacy or broad unseen-mechanism claim is established.","fix":"Report world families separately from mechanisms and retain future independent sealed evaluation custody.","severity":"low","source_role":"independent_adjudicator"}],"reason":"Fresh exact-record expert and adversarial final reviews, independent oracle reexecution and literal metadata checks agree. Prior task/prompt/gold/split are unchanged; this is a factual metadata correction with zero new underlying families.","receipt_id":"adj-pilot-v4-47d027b5b8380d0aa393","record_hash":"577e37afed3123438055fa1e845ec7b963cecff3b28d49ece2c7903d4c02dad2","reviewer_execution_id":"/root/research_architect","reviewer_role":"independent_adjudicator","sample_id":"RVM-001-pilot-v4-p0000-base-forward","scope_limitations":["Actual architect/adjudicator execution never produced training candidates.","Same underlying model across independent agents can leave correlated errors.","Original protected tests and model artifacts were not opened.","Fresh review is independently recomputed, but not fully blind: root supplied prior tag topics, and adjudicator supplied finalized v1 aggregate counts after v1 initial reviews."],"scores":{"difficulty_quality":4,"diversity":3,"generalization_value":3,"instruction_clarity":5,"reasoning_validity":5,"semantic_correctness":5,"shortcut_resistance":3,"target_correctness":5}}
